      "title": "Where payments die (REJECTED branch)",
      "description": "Rejections per minute, by the stage that refused them. This is the product question the technical board cannot answer: RECEIVED means limits and unknown keys, FRAUD_CHECKED means risk policy, DEBITED means insufficient funds. Retryable failures (a ledger outage) are deliberately NOT counted here \u2014 they decide nothing and the retry resurrects the payment.",
